As far as I can tell, the random teleport which happens when you're trying
to escape the dungeon will do the following:
1) If you have intrinsic teleport, you will be moved down a random number
   of levels.
2) If you don't have i.t., you are merely teleported elsewhere on the same
   level.
This makes _not_ having i.t. quite useful, and since there are always
plenty wands of teleport lying around, it's probably not worth having...

